OL,3,CDate announced for long-awaited Tyson
OL,4,CFury and Anthony Joshua fight
OL,6,FA date has finally been announced for
OL,7,Fthe long-awaited fight between Tyson
OL,8,FFury and Anthony Joshua, who will face
OL,9,Feach other in Wales later this year.
OL,11,FThe pair of heavyweight boxers will
OL,12,Ftake to the ring at Cardiff's
OL,13,FPrincipality Stadium on 11 December,
OL,14,Ffor what will be one of the biggest
OL,15,Fbouts in British boxing history.
OL,17,FFury, who is from Morecambe, and
OL,18,FJoshua from Watford, have a long-
OL,19,Fstanding rivalry, with promoters
OL,20,Fdescribing the upcoming fight as "one
OL,21,Fnight to settle it".
