OL,3,CDate announced for long-awaited Tyson
OL,4,CFury and Anthony Joshua fight
OL,6,FThe fight will be streamed globally on
OL,7,FNetflix, at no additional cost.
OL,9,FAhead of the bout, Fury and Joshua
OL,10,Fwill both participate in a press
OL,11,Fconference on 30 September at British
OL,12,FAirways Arc in London.
OL,14,FBoth fighters have held multiple world
OL,15,Ftitles, with Joshua boasting a 30-4
OL,16,Fwin-loss record, while Fury has 36
OL,17,Fwins, two losses and a draw.
