OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1790273930
OL,3,CDate announced for long-awaited Tyson
OL,4,CFury and Anthony Joshua fight
OL,6,FThe details of the highly anticipated
OL,7,Fbout were announced by Turki
OL,8,FAlalshikh, chairman of the General
OL,9,FEntertainment Authority and president
OL,10,Fof the Saudi Boxing Federation.
OL,12,FHe said: "Two of the best heavyweights
OL,13,Fof this generation, finally in the
OL,14,Fring together.
OL,16,F"This will be one of the biggest
OL,17,Ffights in boxing history, I am very
OL,18,Fhappy to make this fight happen for
OL,19,Fthe fans."
